# FTELMarket – .NET CRUD API

## 📌 About the Project

FTELMarket is a RESTful API developed using C# and ASP.NET Core as part of a practical project focused on .NET installation, API development, and CRUD operations.

The application simulates a marketplace where users can manage a product catalog organized by categories.

## 🚀 Features

- **Create:** Add new products to the catalog.
- **Read:** Retrieve products and their categories.
- **Update:** Modify existing product information.
- **Delete:** Remove products from the catalog.
- **Category Management:** Organize products into categories.
- **Database Persistence:** Store data using Entity Framework Core and SQL Server.
- **Code First:** Create and update the database schema using Entity Framework migrations.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- C#
- ASP.NET Core Web API
- .NET 9 / .NET 10
- Entity Framework Core
- SQL Server
- Docker Desktop
- Visual Studio 2022 / 2026
- DBeaver (optional)

## 🗄️ Data Model

**Product**
- Name
- Description (optional)
- Price
- Stock Quantity
- Creation Date
- Category

**Category**
- Name
- Products (one-to-many relationship)

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Understand the structure of a .NET solution and project.
- Develop REST API endpoints using controllers.
- Implement CRUD operations.
- Configure Entity Framework Core.
- Apply the Code First approach and database migrations.
- Connect the API to a database for persistent data storage.

## 👨‍💻 Project Context

Academic practical work focused on learning ASP.NET Core Web API development and database integration.